{
  "bookId": "JOB",
  "chapter": 25,
  "bookEnglish": "Job",
  "bookChineseSimplified": "约伯记",
  "bookChineseTraditional": "約伯記",
  "verses": [
    {
      "verse": "1",
      "en": {
        "text": "Then Bildad the Shuhite answered,",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "书亚人比勒达回答说：",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "書亞人比勒達回答說：",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "2",
      "en": {
        "text": "“Dominion and fear are with him. He makes peace in his high places.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "神有治理之权，有威严可畏； 他在高处施行和平。",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "上帝有治理之權，有威嚴可畏； 他在高處施行和平。",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "3",
      "en": {
        "text": "Can his armies be counted? On whom does his light not arise?",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "他的诸军岂能数算？ 他的光亮一发，谁不蒙照呢？",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "他的諸軍豈能數算？ 他的光亮一發，誰不蒙照呢？",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "4",
      "en": {
        "text": "How then can man be just with God? Or how can he who is born of a woman be clean?",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "这样在 神面前，人怎能称义？ 妇人所生的怎能洁净？",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "這樣在上帝面前，人怎能稱義？ 婦人所生的怎能潔淨？",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "5",
      "en": {
        "text": "Behold, even the moon has no brightness, and the stars are not pure in his sight;",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "在 神眼前，月亮也无光亮， 星宿也不清洁。",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "在上帝眼前，月亮也無光亮， 星宿也不清潔。",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "6",
      "en": {
        "text": "How much less man, who is a worm, and the son of man, who is a worm!”",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "何况如虫的人， 如蛆的世人呢！",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "何況如蟲的人， 如蛆的世人呢！",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    }
  ]
}